          "content_blocks": [
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "IgM cold agglutinins—immunosuppressive therapy not very effective against IgMmediated disorders, but can be tried (i.e., corticosteroids, leflunomide, cyclosporine).",
